goodix5201: driver for the Goodix 27c6:5201 fingerprint reader (ASUS ZenBook S UX391UA/UX391FA),
with its autosuspend hwdb entry and a umockdev replay test. Uses SIGFM (sigfm-mr530.patch).
Source, protocol documentation and tests: https://github.com/J0UH/goodix-5201-linux

